#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) to manage users with or without an IBM Cloud account"
msgstr "Gunakan IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) untuk mengurus pengguna dengan atau tanpa akaun IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users"
msgstr "Urus pengguna penyedia ID"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users {#manage-id-provider-users}"
msgstr "Urus pengguna penyedia ID {#manage-id-provider-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can integrate with your external identity provider (IDP) to securely authenticate external users to your IBM Cloud account. By using an external provider, you can provide a way for users in your company to use single sign-on (SSO). You can connect your cloud account to an external IDP one of the following ways:\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh berintegrasi dengan penyedia identiti luaran (IDP) anda untuk mengesahkan pengguna luaran ke akaun IBM Cloud anda secara selamat. Dengan menggunakan penyedia luaran, anda boleh menyediakan cara untuk pengguna dalam syarikat anda menggunakan log masuk tunggal (SSO). Anda boleh menghubungkan akaun awan anda ke IDP luaran dengan salah satu cara berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider (SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"
msgstr "Gunakan [penyedia perkhidmatan (SP) SAML IBM Cloud&reg;](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-appid) (might incur a cost)\n"
msgstr "Gunakan [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-appid) (mungkin dikenakan kos)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Federate your users to all IBM&reg; products with IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-ibmid)\n"
msgstr "[Federasi pengguna anda ke semua produk IBM&reg; dengan IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-ibmid)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"After connecting your IDP, you can set up dynamic rules so you don't have to manually add every user to every group when they join.  See [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) for instructions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Selepas menghubungkan IDP anda, anda boleh menyediakan peraturan dinamik supaya anda tidak perlu menambah setiap pengguna secara manual ke setiap kumpulan apabila mereka menyertai. Lihat [Mendayakan pengesahan daripada penyedia identiti luaran](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) untuk arahan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * Refer to the [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration) topic.\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"   * Rujuk topik [Mendayakan pengesahan daripada penyedia identiti luaran](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration).\n"
"   * Lihat [Panduan Federasi SAML IBM Cloud](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"
"   * Rujuk [dokumentasi App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started) yang lengkap.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
